{"id": "bart-m-line-fixture-settlement", "title": "BART canceled a lighting contract, then ordered the fixtures", "seconds": 61.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "86dfc80030d0c92c", "words": 196, "beats": [{"scene": "contract", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "BART hired ABM to replace lights in the M-Line tunnel.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.81, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Why", "buy", "lights", "after", "canceling", "the", "contract?"], "sub": "BART M-Line tunnel"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.56, 0.99, 1.1, 1.45, 1.7, 1.78, 1.89, 2.24]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Its board awarded the contract in 2018 for more than eleven million dollars.", "t0": 2.93, "t1": 7.18, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "Bay Area Rapid Transit", "text": "2018 Board award", "mark": "2018 Board award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.48, 0.82, 0.92, 1.46, 1.57, 1.9, 2.47, 2.68, 2.86, 3.05, 3.37, 3.7]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The inspector general found BART gave one fixture manufacturer an advantage.", "t0": 7.3, "t1": 10.93, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Product selection", "mark": "Product selection"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.57, 0.9, 1.14, 1.42, 1.65, 1.84, 2.18, 2.9, 3.03]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "After cancellation, BART directed the contractor to complete the order for 2,182 fixtures.", "t0": 11.05, "t1": 16.24, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Order completed after cancellation", "heading": "What BART told the contractor to buy", "source": "investigation", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Light fixtures", "value": "2,182"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Spare lights", "value": "100"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Spare drivers", "value": "50"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.85, 1.13, 1.49, 1.59, 2.09, 2.19, 2.5, 2.62, 2.86, 3.01, 3.24, 3.66, 3.83, 4.21, 4.64]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The order also included 100 spare lights and 50 spare drivers.", "t0": 16.36, "t1": 19.64, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Spare equipment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.35, 0.6, 1.02, 1.18, 1.44, 1.72, 2.03, 2.19, 2.48, 2.7]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The price of the equipment was $819,567.28.", "t0": 19.76, "t1": 25.68, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$819,567.28", "label": "Lighting purchase within the settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.35, 0.43, 0.55, 1.05, 1.22, 1.44, 1.84, 2.28, 3.15, 3.47, 3.79, 4.38, 4.83, 4.99, 5.46]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "It was part of the 2.4 million dollar contractor settlement.", "t0": 25.8, "t1": 28.65, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Contractor settlement", "mark": "Contractor settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.2, 0.37, 0.47, 0.57, 0.82, 1.11, 1.35, 1.63, 1.91, 2.44]}, {"scene": "contract", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["defense[0]"], "text": "BART said canceling the purchase order would cost more than buying the lights.", "t0": 28.77, "t1": 32.46, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The purchase order"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.56, 1.05, 1.16, 1.59, 1.86, 2.03, 2.38, 2.65, 2.83, 3.11, 3.21]}, {"scene": "project", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "BART’s later capital report listed spending for the entire project.", "t0": 32.68, "t1": 35.99, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "q4", "kicker": "Bay Area Rapid Transit", "text": "Fiscal 2026 fourth-quarter report", "mark": "Fiscal 2026 fourth-quarter report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.7, 1.07, 1.43, 1.76, 2.18, 2.3, 2.41, 2.74]}, {"scene": "project", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "By the end of fiscal 2026, BART reported nearly nine million dollars spent.", "t0": 36.11, "t1": 39.97, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$8,954,514", "label": "Cumulative project spending"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.27, 0.41, 0.51, 0.86, 1.1, 1.82, 2.11, 2.49, 2.75, 2.93, 3.18, 3.47]}, {"scene": "project", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "All four quarterly reports put completion at 19 percent and closeout in FY29.", "t0": 40.09, "t1": 45.21, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "19% complete"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.48, 0.88, 1.28, 1.44, 1.92, 2.03, 2.37, 2.75, 2.9, 3.54, 3.75, 4.09, 4.26, 4.53]}, {"scene": "project", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The original contract had called for completion in January 2021.", "t0": 45.33, "t1": 48.74, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "original", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "January 2021 completion date", "mark": "January 2021 completion date"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.48, 0.95, 1.06, 1.27, 1.41, 1.96, 2.09, 2.56, 2.83]}, {"scene": "project", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In fiscal 2026, the recommendation on reporting the schedule to the board remained open.", "t0": 48.86, "t1": 53.75, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "annual", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Fiscal 2026 inspector general report", "mark": "Fiscal 2026 inspector general report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.6, 0.89, 1.9, 2.07, 2.74, 2.85, 3.23, 3.33, 3.71, 3.83, 3.93, 4.2, 4.53]}, {"scene": "project", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "Cumulative spending includes project work. It does not measure how much the fixture decision cost.", "t0": 53.87, "t1": 58.56, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Net financial loss"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.89, 1.26, 1.66, 2.28, 2.42, 2.59, 2.78, 3.11, 3.21, 3.4, 3.52, 3.85, 4.22]}, {"scene": "project", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 58.68, "t1": 60.83, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"contract": "Buying the tunnel lights", "project": "What the capital report measures"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "question"}